      "name": "image_uri",
      "options": [
        "--image-uri"
      ],
      "raw_name": "ImageUri",
      "required": true,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "description_zh": "添加盲水印前图片的OSS URI。\n\n对于DWT和DWT_IBG算法模型无需设置此参数。\n\nOSS地址规则为`oss://bucket/object`，其中bucket为和当前项目处于同一区域的OSS Bucket名称，object为文件路径。",
      "example": "oss://imm-test/testcases/watermarktestbefore.jpg",
      "help_en": "The OriginalImageUri",
      "help_zh": "添加盲水印前图片的OSS URI。\n\n对于DWT和DWT_IBG算法模型无需设置此参数。\n\nOSS地址规则为`oss://bucket/object`，其中bucket为和当前项目处于同一区域的OSS Bucket名称，object为文件路径",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "original_image_uri",
      "options": [
        "--original-image-uri"
      ],
      "raw_name": "OriginalImageUri",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "description_zh": "解析盲水印后图片保存到的OSS URI。\n\nOSS地址规则为`oss://bucket/object`，其中bucket为和当前项目处于同一区域的OSS Bucket名称，object为文件路径。",
      "example": "oss://imm-test/testcases/decodewatermarktest.jpg",
      "help_en": "The TargetUri",
      "help_zh": "解析盲水印后图片保存到的OSS URI。\n\nOSS地址规则为`oss://bucket/object`，其中bucket为和当前项目处于同一区域的OSS Bucket名称，object为文件路径",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "target_uri",
      "options": [
        "--target-uri"
      ],
      "raw_name": "TargetUri",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "description_zh": "输出图片的质量，默认值为90，取值范围为70~100。\n\n质量越高，图片尺寸越大，水印解析质量越高。",
      "example": "90",
      "help_en": "The ImageQuality",
      "help_zh": "输出图片的质量，默认值为90，取值范围为70~100。\n\n质量越高，图片尺寸越大，水印解析质量越高",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "image_quality",
      "options": [
        "--image-quality"
      ],
      "raw_name": "ImageQuality",
      "required": false,
      "type": "int"
    },
    {
      "description_zh": "水印算法模型，默认值为FFT，可选值包括FFT、FFT\\_FULL、DWT和DWT\\_IBG。\n\n关于不同算法模型的区别，请参见[EncodeBlindWatermark](https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/138800.html)中的算法模型。\n\n> 对同一张图片，添加盲水印和解析盲水印时必须使用同一种算法，否则图片的水印无法进行解析。",
      "example": "DWT_IBG",
      "help_en": "The Model",
      "help_zh": "水印算法模型，默认值为FFT，可选值包括FFT、FFT\\_FULL、DWT和DWT\\_IBG。\n\n关于不同算法模型的区别，请参见[EncodeBlindWatermark](https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/138800.html)中的算法模型。\n\n> 对同一张图片，添加盲水印和解析盲水印时必须使用同一种算法，否则图片的水印无法进行解析",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "model",
      "options": [
        "--model"
      ],
      "raw_name": "Model",
      "required": false,
